    "created_at": "2016-10-12T16:02:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-12T16:02:11Z",
    "body": "Hmm I see. Yeah, I don't see any term for that. \"Editable element\" is probably not great since it collides with https://w3c.github.io/editing/execCommand.html#editable.\n\nThe closest I can find is \"elements for which the [select()](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-textarea/input-select) method [applies](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-input-apply).\" See the \"applies\" table to get an idea why.\n\n(I guess we should have moved this to another issue...)\n",
